  - HDMI
  - RJ-45
  - Audio
  shortDescription: Where your keyboard, mouse, network and speakers connect.
  whatItDoes: The rear I/O panel exposes the motherboard's USB, video, network and
    audio ports through the back of the case.
  keyFacts:
  - USB-A for keyboard and mouse
  - RJ-45 for wired network
  - Green audio jack for speakers
  installationSteps:
  - Connect keyboard and mouse to USB.
  - Connect the monitor to the graphics card (not HDMI here) if you have one.
  - Plug in Ethernet and speakers.
  safetyTip: 
